This is a new Vue 3 codebase rather than a fork of an existing one.
Parts of it are nonetheless derived from the project's previous Vue 2
web panel: a number of components, layout calculations, default values
and interface strings were ported from it, in several cases verbatim,
so that behaviour stayed identical across the rewrite.

That earlier panel is itself a fork of the CasaOS project. The ported
material therefore includes software originally developed by IceWhale
Technology Co., Ltd. as part of CasaOS
